flowchart LR
  User[Person describes goal]
  Composer[Workflow composer]
  Proposal[Unsaved workflow proposal]
  Review[Human reviews and edits]
  Editor[Normal scoped workflow editor]
  Policy{Selected collection can write?}
  Save[Explicit save action]
  Store[(Collection-scoped catalog)]
  NoExec[No automatic save or execution]
  User --> Composer --> Proposal --> Review --> Editor --> Policy
  Policy -->|no| NoExec
  Policy -->|yes| Save --> Store
  Composer -. generation never commits .-> Store
